  "content": "<p style=\"display: flex;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 135px;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/226/257/beachmodded.gif\" alt=\"美麗沙灘效果\" width=\"278\" height=\"199\"> <img style=\"margin-left: 8px;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/226/328/flooding.gif\" alt=\"水流擴散\" width=\"278\" height=\"199\"></p>\n<p style=\"display: flex;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"margin-left: 8px;\" src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/requires-balm.png\" alt=\"需搭配Balm\" width=\"260\" height=\"80\"></a> <a href=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/sponsor\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"margin-left: 26px;\" src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/new-patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon贊助\" width=\"550\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p>本模組調整了在水邊挖掘沙子時的水體物理效果，避免產生難看的流動水方塊。現在您可以放心挖掘需要的沙子，不用擔心破壞環境景觀。</p>\n<p>支援NeoForge、Fabric和Forge平台。需搭配<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/balm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Balm</a>共同安裝使用。</p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/features-header.png\" alt=\"功能特色\" width=\"836\" height=\"40\"></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>破壞水邊的沙子會立即生成水源方塊</li>\n<li>挖掘沙子時，水體會自動填補周圍凹洞</li>\n<li>不再被流動水推擠或留下不自然的挖掘痕跡</li>\n<li>注意：本模組會無償生成水源，不適用於需要限制水資源的遊戲情境</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1001/697/meme.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"730\" height=\"592\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
